      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1943008121464533200",
      "text": "[6:59PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nBusy movement along the service lane, Anthony inward Maryland intersection, and onwards to Odo'yalaro.\n\nMovement is slightly busy along the service lane, Anthony to Maryland Intersection.\n\nSmooth flow ahead to Odo'yalaro and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way.\n\nHigh influx of traffic at Customs along Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way inward journey Kodesoh Road, Awolowo Way en route the Link Bridge connecting Ikeja Along.\n\nThe return journey is good at Kodesoh Road inward journey Local Airport Road, Oba Akinjobi Way, Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way and Ikeja G.R.A respectively.\n\nHowever, our officers are on ground controlling traffic at their respective locations, ensuring a smooth flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
